---
layout: base.jinja
title: "Trail log: the changelog"
description: What's new in each release of SiteSquatch, written for people, with what you might need to change.
permalink: /changelog/
---
<section class="entries">
	<div class="wrap entry-wrap">
		<p class="kicker">Release notes</p>
		<h1>Trail log: the changelog</h1>
		<p class="lead">What's new in each release, and what you might need to change when you upgrade. Every change, down to the last fix, is in <a href="{{ site.repo }}/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md">CHANGELOG.md</a>. Follow along with the <a href="/changelog/feed.xml">Atom feed</a>.</p>
		<ol class="entry-list">
			{%- for entry in collections.changelog %}
			<li>
				<p class="entry-date"><time datetime="{{ entry.data.updated }}">{{ (entry.data.lastDate or entry.date) | dateformat("%-d %B %Y") }}</time></p>
				<h2><a href="{{ entry.url }}">{{ entry.data.title }}</a></h2>
				{{ entry.templateContent | firstParagraph | safe }}
			</li>
			{%- endfor %}
		</ol>
	</div>
</section>
